<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  THE METER. Traffic, device allowance, any determinate quantity.
  22-components.md 17.2, 32-master-plan-android.md 8.11.
  ============================================================================

      Label ......................................... Value
                              8
      [==================================               ]   6 tall, round ends

  THE LABEL IS NEVER PRINTED ON TOP OF THE FILL. The shipped subscription meta bar
  centres an 11sp label over a moving accent fill: 2.9:1, and it changes mid-word as
  the bar advances. That is the defect this file ends — the label sits BESIDE the
  bar, on its own line, at the full 4.5:1 body floor.

  The fill is SOLID accent. No gradient: a gradient encodes nothing a solid fill of
  the same width does not (6.5), and bg_traffic_gradient is the shipped violation.

  RUNTIME, all of it token-faithful:
      meterBar.progress = pct                       animate over motion_state 220ms
      over quota (>= 100%)  fill -> ?attr/colorError and the value says «Лимит исчерпан»
      unlimited             meterBar.isVisible = false and the value reads
                            «12,4 ГБ · без ограничений» — a bar with no ceiling is a lie
      no data (userinfo 0)  hide this whole view rather than draw 0 B / 0 B

  The value keeps the UI face because «12,4 из 50 ГБ» is a Russian phrase and a
  sentence never ripples between two faces (D-2). A value that is a bare figure wants
  the Numeric role at Subtitle metrics; that ramp style does not exist yet and is
  filed with the styles owner.
-->
<LinearLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    xmlns:tools="http://schemas.android.com/tools"
    android:id="@+id/meter"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
    android:orientation="vertical">

    <LinearLayout
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:baselineAligned="true"
        android:orientation="horizontal">

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/meter_label"
            android:layout_width="0dp"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_weight="1"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Subtitle"
            tools:text="Трафик" />

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/meter_value"
            android:layout_width="wrap_content"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:layout_marginStart="@dimen/space_12"
            android:gravity="end"
            android:maxLines="2"
            android:textAppearance="@style/TextAppearance.App.Subtitle"
            tools:text="12,4 из 50 ГБ" />
    </LinearLayout>

    <com.google.android.material.progressindicator.LinearProgressIndicator
        android:id="@+id/meter_bar"
        style="@style/Widget.Departament.Progress.Linear"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
        android:layout_marginTop="@dimen/space_8"
        android:max="100"
        android:progress="0"
        tools:progress="25" />
</LinearLayout>
